rong></div>`).join('')}</div><h3>Driving directions</h3><p>${esc(j.directions||'No directions added.')}</p><h3>Instructions</h3><p>${esc(j.notes||jobServiceLabel(j))}</p><div class="driver-secondary">${['arrival',...(j.representativeMode==='separate'?['departure']:[])].map(kind=>{const phone=safeTelHref(representativeForJob(j,kind).phone);return phone?`<a class="btn" href="${esc(phone)}">Call ${j.representativeMode==='separate'?kind+' ':''}representative</a>`:'';}).join('')}${j.coordinates?`<a class="btn" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=${encodeURIComponent(j.coordinates)}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open directions</a>`:''}</div>${attachmentsHtml(j)}</details></div></section>`;}

function driverFluidSummary(assignment,jobRecord){
  const services=enabledHourlyFluidServices(jobRecord);
  if(!services.length)return '';
  const actual=assignment.hourlyFluidQuantities;
  const counts=actual||Object.fromEntries(services.map(({key})=>[key,jobRecord.hourlyFluidServices[key].estimatedQuantity]));
  return `<div class="summary-list"><strong>${actual?'Confirmed water deliveries':'Estimated water deliveries'}</strong>${fluidQuantityRows(services,counts).map(([label,value])=>`<div class="summary-row"><span>${esc(label)}</span><strong>${esc(value)}</strong></div>`).join('')}</div>`;
}

function missingPerLoadRecords(a){
  return (a.billingMode||job(a.jobId)?.billingMode)==='load'&&!a.loads?.length;
}
function canRecoverMissedLoads(a){
  return a.status==='off-location'&&missingPerLoadRecords(a)&&
